      "id": 115,
      "start": 287.72,
      "end": 288.72,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "start": 288.72,
      "end": 292.08,
      "en": "So when you take more than two steps, then it's traveling.",
      "zh": "所以当你走超过两步时，就是走步违例。"
