    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "start": 364.08,
      "end": 369.64,
      "en": "Okay, today on Fluency Builder, we have two really common words that you would listen to while you're watching a game.",
      "zh": "好的，今天在流利表达上，我们有两个非常常见的词，您在观看比赛时会听。"
